   fe_out_w         117.9900  GEN: board A's front end U2 limits at VSNS 57 mV over R11 10 mOhm, 5.7 A at 20.7 V (gen_sch_e.py:104-107 as energy_inputs.yaml front_end_draw_w reads it)
