   iin_lid_a          8.0000  SESSION: U3B IIN_HOST 8.0 A nominal from VBAT, code 80 (seven bits of 100 mA with RAC 5 mOhm, RSNS_RAC = 1b, SLUSE66A 9.6.22 Table 9-50, page 80; 8.2 A maximum with the 200 mA the register text adds); 3.3 uH on IADPT's 169 k so that Table 9-1 allows 10 A
